      "evidence": "The architecture now separates build source, update source, target build, package, signed artifact, update ID, group, and rollback ID. However, validBuild and validUpdate do not require platform, environment, runtime, channel, or nativeDigest. The independent exact-head invariants lane removed the same one of those fields from build and update. All five cases installed and activated with zero violations because missing values compared equal.",
      "impact": "The model architecture permits equality of absent mandatory compatibility identity. MODEL_CLEAR can therefore represent an OTA whose platform, environment, runtime, channel, or native capability digest is unproved, contrary to the release/OTA ownership contract.",
      "requiredResolution": "Require nonempty, appropriately enumerated platform, environment, runtime, channel, and nativeDigest in build and update validation; add build, activation, rollback-target, and rollback missing-field regressions; then rerun all exact-head review lanes.",
